        },
        {
          "text": " Nu kes airumeta nuerumete idwe luka Isirael kakwap naka Kanaan, nuakorokoroete Eleasar esasedoti, ka Yosua okoku loka Nun, ka ikapolok luka ikalia luka lukapapaakee luka atekerin nuka idwe luka Isirael, ",
