        {
          "text": " Naarai araas idwe luka Yosep atekerin aarei, Manase ka Epuraim: mam apotu koinakis Ilebin akorakinet kakwap dimarai ireria luiboioto, ka ironyiakec kanuka ibarenekec ka iborokec. ",
          "type": "text",
