        {
          "text": " Kosodete idwe luka Yuda aikunyakin mama ajai Yosua Giligal: kotema Kaleb okoku loka Yepune Ekenisit ŋes atiar, “Ŋeni ijo akirot naabu EJAKAIT kolimok Musa etuŋanan loka Edeke nakalimitor eoŋ ka jo koKades-barunea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
