              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiyapoik Musa kapaaran kaŋin ebe, ‘Abeit akwap naecak akonikeju eraun airumetekon ka naka idwekon ikar kere, naarai itup eut EJAKAIT Ekadeke.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
