        {
          "text": " Ido koany, ketubut EJAKAIT eoŋ, kwape abu kolimunio, ikar lu akaisaoŋon ka lukany, ameun kapak naalimokinia EJAKAIT Musa akirot nin, kirim Isirael kamodiŋ: aso koany, arai lolo eoŋ loka ikar akaisakanykauni ka lukany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
